**Top 10 Digital Skills for Employment & Life**

Based on the DfE Essential Digital Skills Framework, the FutureDotNow
AI-updated EDS (October 2025), and World Economic Forum Future of Jobs
Report 2025. These ten skills represent the universal baseline every
learner, employee and citizen needs.

